+N90-161 p. 6 separately lists the September 17 and updated October 2 custody lists. Its p. 1 default extraction gives **9138 #180** within the concatenated row, and the location cell's extracted text is **~~i~:~cin**. The image gives the row above. The 2003 copies repeat the same location field and may share a source. A checkout, inventory-change or transfer entry keyed to the disk and its serial would test whether the difference reflects movement of the physical copy or a change in listing. The relationship between the 2004 reproduction estimate and disk 180 is also untested. [Exact image regions, text locators and hashes](SOURCE-PINS.json)
+
+Verification covered **three newly acquired public PDFs totaling 11 physical pages**, selected fields of three held copies, **29 exact text anchors**, four image-row checks and the cost arithmetic. The work identifies a regional search and copying route for the April request. The actual Technical Center work and transfer records, national final response and receipt, TSA intake for the separate August request, May 2003 correction and signed FAA disposition remain open. [Source pins](SOURCE-PINS.json) · [Text addition](TEXT-CHANGES.diff)
